Nearly everything passes. One real finding: **continue button disabled after reload despite an active run**.

Why? The defeat→retry→victory happened on floor 2. After victory we clicked continue → returnToDungeon → persist(). run.floor = 2, party exists. Then page.reload().

`loadState()`:
```js
const parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
